$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~8 min | Difficulty: Medium]] The Halyard keeps getting painted by something DRADIS cannot see. A stealthed Advanced Raider is shadowing her and reporting her position. Red flight has to find it by eye and kill it before it calls the basestar.", -1)
$end_multi_text

